                        "glosses": [
                            "A Low German variety, spoken in the German state of North Rhine-Westphalia (in Wuppertal, Radevormwald, Hückeswagen, Wipperfürth, Marienheide, Wernscheid, Gummersbach, Bergneustadt) and with borders to Bergisch (in the North-West), Ripuarisch (in the South) and Westfälisch (in the North-East and East)."
